  "bio": "Jorge Gª Calvete is a highly skilled tattoo artist located in A Coruña, Spain, who specializes in intricate fineline, dotwork, and offers vegan tattoo options. With a fine attention to detail, Jorge's blackwork, neotraditional styles, and lettering demonstrate a level of craftsmanship that caters to the bespoke needs of each client. His professionalism is reflected in his pristine workspace at Anden Tattoo, ensuring a clean and comfortable experience for all who seek his artistry.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: A Coruña, Galicia, Spain"
}